立，曰：『太子死，有母弟可立，不即立長。年鈞擇賢，義鈞則卜之。今裯非適嗣，且又居喪意不在戚而有喜色，若果立，必爲季氏憂。』季武子弗聽，卒立之。比及葬，三易衰。君子曰：『是不終也。』","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cp2_vf3_igr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"穆叔","kind":"person","person_id":"18r_wn6_nhh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"pzz_h6y_gwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"母弟","kind":"person","person_id":"rur_xf3_opk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"裯","kind":"person","person_id":"cp2_vf3_igr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"季氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、論贊署稱、地點氏稱或未定指代；不補姓名、爵位與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0076","start":76,"end":79,"surface":"季武子","kind":"person","person_id":"nvt_gxa_pdo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"君子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、論贊署稱、地點氏稱或未定指代；不補姓名、爵位與成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-ws2506399-peiwei","source":{"title":"《晉書》卷三十五子頠完整附傳選錄","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=晉書/卷035&oldid=2506399","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=晉書/卷035&oldid=2506399","revision_id":2506399,"accessed_on":"2026-10-24","extent":"子頠附傳完整十五自然段，含晉書收到崇有之論全部引文容器及二子敘述；非裴秀全傳/卷035全卷或獨立原著全文。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status"